     A* SALESRPT.DSPF -- WORKSTN display file for the SALESRPT report
     A* (mock-as400 RPG interpreter).

     A                                      DSPSIZ(24 80 *DS3)

     A          R DETAIL                    CF03(03)
     A                                  1 25'QUARTERLY SALES REPORT'
     A                                  3  3'Region:'
     A            REGNAME       12   O  3 13
     A                                  5  3'Amount: $'
     A            REGAMT         9  2O  5 14
     A                                 22  3'Press Enter for next region, F3=Exit'

     A          R TOTAL                     CF03(03)
     A                                  1 28'FINAL TOTALS'
     A                                  3  3'Total Revenue: $'
     A            GRANDTOT       9  2O  3 21
     A                                  5  3'Average per Region: $'
     A            AVGAMT         9  2O  5 25
     A                                 22  3'Press Enter or F3 to exit'
